</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Our fathers, chained in prisons dark,</l><l>Were still in heart and conscience free;</l><l>And blest would be their children’s fate,</l><l>If they, like them should die for thee:</l><l>Faith of our fathers! holy faith!</l><l>We will be true to thee till death!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Faith of our fathers, we will strive</l><l>To win all nations unto thee;</l><l>And through the truth that comes from God</l><l>Mankind shall then indeed be free.</l><l>Faith of our fathers! holy faith!</l><l>We will be true to thee till death!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Faith of our fathers, we will love</l><l>Both friend and foe in all our strife,</l><l>And preach thee, too, as love knows how</l><l>By kindly words and virtuous life.</l><l>Faith of our fathers! holy faith!</l><l>We will be true to thee till death!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
